      "message": "FYI a difference between these historic versions is that OpenJDK was using the numbering scheme 1.6, 1.7, 1.8 but then switched to 9. I think we could argue that those should be the normalized form of those version numbers, but I don\u0027t know to what extent that might break .bp / .mk files that might currently use the other way, so I\u0027m fine with this CL here also.",
